lary_any":20,"city":22,"company":22,"employment_type":189,"remote":22,"posted_at":190},0.353,0.167,{"within_source_rule_pl":192,"cross_source_estimate":193,"cross_source_note_pl":194},"Ta sama oferta w tym samym serwisie liczona raz (klucz: adres URL lub identyfikator ogłoszenia).",0.379,"Szacunkowy odsetek ogłoszeń widocznych w więcej niż jednym serwisie (ten sam tytuł, firma i miasto w tym samym miesiącu). Wskaźniki liczymy po zdjęciu tych powtórek.",[196,203,209,215],{"id":197,"icon":198,"title_pl":199,"text_pl":200,"title_en":201,"text_en":202},"volume","trend","Sierpień: 4 486 ogłoszeń","4 486 nowych ogłoszeń.","August: 4,486 postings","4,486 new postings.",{"id":204,"icon":204,"title_pl":205,"text_pl":206,"title_en":207,"text_en":208},"remote","Praca zdalna: 4,2% ogłoszeń","303 ogłoszeń oznaczonych jako praca zdalna.","Remote work: 4.2% of postings","303 postings flagged as remote.",{"id":210,"icon":210,"title_pl":211,"text_pl":212,"title_en":213,"text_en":214},"source","Największy serwis: Tanqeeb (100%)","Dane z 1 serwisu; Tanqeeb dostarcza 7 219 z 7 219 ogłoszeń przed zdjęciem powtórek.","Largest source: Tanqeeb (100%)","Data from 1 source; Tanqeeb provides 7,219 of 7,219 postings before de-duplication.",{"id":216,"icon":217,"title_pl":218,"text_pl":219,"title_en":220,"text_en":221},"cities","map","15 miast z ogłoszeniami","Najwięcej w: Amman (47%), Aqaba (3%), Irbid (0%).","15 cities with postings","Most in: Amman (47%), Aqaba (3%), Irbid (0%).",{"month":12,"generated_at":223,"model":224,"is_ai":145,"lead_pl":225,"body_pl":226,"bullets_pl":227,"caveats_pl":231,"lead_en":232,"body_en":233,"bullets_en":234,"based_on":238},"2026-09-30T16:36:47+00:00","claude-opus-5-5","W sierpniu 2026 r. 46,6% internetowych ofert pracy z Jordanii wskazywało Amman, a kwotę wynagrodzenia podawał tylko 1% ofert.","W sierpniu 2026 r. zebraliśmy 4 486 nowych internetowych ofert pracy z Jordanii. Przed zdjęciem powtórek było ich 7 219. Wszystkie pochodzą z jednego serwisu, agregatora Tanqeeb. Zbieranie ruszyło 4 sierpnia, więc część miesiąca odtworzono z dat publikacji widocznych w serwisie. Brak porównań miesiąc do miesiąca i rok do roku.\n\nOferty skupiają się w stolicy. Amman wskazywało 46,6% ofert, Akabę 2,6%, Irbid i Al-Azrak po 0,3%. W 49,8% ofert jako lokalizację podano tylko kraj. Wśród ofert z podanym miastem na Amman przypadało około 92,9%. Oferty dotyczyły łącznie 15 miejscowości.\n\nFormę zatrudnienia określono w mniejszości ofert. Pełny etat wskazywało 35,8%, umowę kontraktową 0,3%, część etatu 0,1%. W 63,9% ofert brak tej informacji. Pracę zdalną oznaczono w 4,2% ofert, czyli w 303 ogłoszeniach.\n\nKwotę wynagrodzenia podawał 1% ofert. To za mało, by wyznaczyć medianę płac.",[228,229,230],"4 486 nowych ofert po zdjęciu powtórek (7 219 przed)","Amman: 46,6% ofert; tylko kraj bez miasta: 49,8%","Praca zdalna: 4,2% ofert (303 ogłoszenia)","Dane obejmują wyłącznie internetowe oferty pracy z jednego serwisu (Tanqeeb), a nie cały rynek pracy. Zbieranie trwa od 4 sierpnia 2026 r., więc sierpień jest niepełny. Kwotę wynagrodzenia podaje tylko 1% ofert.","In August 2026, 46.6% of online job offers from Jordan named Amman, and only 1% of offers stated a salary amount.","In August 2026 we collected 4,486 new online job offers from Jordan. Before removing duplicates there were 7,219. All come from a single service, the Tanqeeb aggregator. Collection started on 4 August, so part of the month was reconstructed from publication dates visible on the service. There are no month-on-month or year-on-year comparisons.\n\nOffers are concentrated in the capital. Amman was named in 46.6% of offers, Aqaba in 2.6%, and Irbid and Al Azraq in 0.3% each. In 49.8% of offers only the country was given as the location. Among offers with a specified city, Amman accounted for about 92.9%. Offers covered 15 locations in total.\n\nThe employment type was stated in a minority of offers. Full-time was indicated in 35.8%, contract in 0.3% and part-time in 0.1%. In 63.9% of offers this information was missing. Remote work was marked in 4.2% of offers, or 303 postings.\n\nA salary amount was given in 1% of offers. That is too few to calculate a median wage.",[235,236,237],"4,486 new offers after removing duplicates (7,219 before)","Amman: 46.6% of offers; country only, no city: 49.8%","Remote work: 4.2% of offers (303 postings)","4486|None|0.042",{"is_synthetic":145,"note_pl":240,"months":241,"groups":247,"skills":307},"Dane demonstracyjne: nazwy umiejętności pochodzą z taksonomii ESCO, wartości są wygenerowane. Docelowo - identyfikacja umiejętności w treści ogłoszeń.",[242,243,244,245,246,12],"2026-03","2026-04","2026-05","2026-06","2026-07",[248,254,260,266,272,278,284,290,295,301],{"id":249,"name_pl":250,"name_en":251,"share":252,"change_pct":253},"digital","Kompetencje cyfrowe","Digital skills",0.161,11.9,{"id":255,"name_pl":256,"name_en":257,"share":258,"change_pct":259},"data_ai","Dane i sztuczna inteligencja","Data & AI",0.07,12,{"id":261,"name_pl":262,"name_en":263,"share":264,"change_pct":265},"green","Zielone kompetencje","Green skills",0.037,7.6,{"id":267,"name_pl":268,"name_en":269,"share":270,"change_pct":271},"management","Zarządzanie","Management",0.117,0.5,{"id":273,"name_pl":274,"name_en":275,"share":276,"change_pct":277},"communication","Komunikacja i współpraca","Communication & teamwork",0.128,-3.5,{"id":279,"name_pl":280,"name_en":281,"share":282,"change_pct":283},"technical_trades","Zawody techniczne i produkcja","Technical trades",0.104,-6.5,{"id":285,"name_pl":286,"name_en":287,"share":288,"change_pct":289},"healthcare","Opieka zdrowotna","Healthcare",0.073,5.1,{"id":291,"name_pl":292,"name_en":293,"share":294,"change_pct":283},"finance_admin","Finanse i administracja","Finance & administration",0.098,{"id":296,"name_pl":297,"name_en":298,"share":299,"change_pct":300},"languages","Języki obce","Languages",0.095,-3.8,{"id":302,"name_pl":303,"name_en":304,"share":305,"change_pct":306},"customer_sales","Obsłu